The Open AGI Summit: Where the Future Gathers.

The Open AGI Summit isn’t a conference, it is a movement checkpoint. Researchers, founders, engineers, philosophers, and policymakers gather to shape the future of open-source AGI.

The Summit is where new governance ideas emerge. Where multi agent breakthroughs are unveiled and where open-source alliances form. It is also where the culture of open AGI is reinforced.

@sentient_found uses the Summit to coordinate global momentum. Think of it as the Davos of open intelligence but transparent, collaborative, and mission driven. 

The Summit is becoming the gravitational center of open source AI. If AGI is the next internet, this is where its architects meet. You can register through the link below: https://t.co/Jqb0jxqsoL
